        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 134830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Às vezes, queremos formatar parágrafos com quebras de linha.</p><p>Por exemplo, esta música ficaria muito melhor se <code>Raindrops on roses</code> aparecesse em uma linha, <code>Whiskers on kittens</code> na próxima, e assim por diante.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;h1&gt;My favorite things&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt; Raindrops on roses Whiskers on kittens Bright copper kettles Warm&#xA; woolen mittens &lt;/p&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Line breaks",
            "id": 134837,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos separar linhas com a ajuda da <strong>tag de quebra de linha</strong>: <code>br</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bright copper kettles \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos separar linhas com a ajuda da <strong>tag de quebra de linha</strong>: <code>br</code>. Ela fica sozinha, então não tem tag de fechamento.</p><p>Faça cada coisa favorita aparecer em sua própria linha dentro do parágrafo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> e finalmente <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Empty tags",
            "id": 134831,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>&lt;br&gt;</code> é uma <strong>tag vazia</strong>. Tags vazias não têm tag de fechamento e nem conteúdo. Elas também são chamadas de tags auto-fechadas.</p><p>Coloque junto a tag de quebra de linha.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"107\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Emphasis",
            "id": 134812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Há um elemento para dar ênfase ao texto. Ele o deixa <em>itálico</em>. Ele é chamado de elemento <code>em</code>. Adicione <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Há um elemento para dar ênfase ao texto. Ele o deixa itálico. Ele é chamado de elemento <code>em</code>.</p><p>Envolva a palavra certa para que apenas rosas fique em destaque.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Importance",
            "id": 134813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para definir um texto como importante, usamos as tags <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>. Elas deixam o texto em <strong>negrito</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para definir um texto como importante, usamos as tags <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>. Elas deixam o texto em negrito.</p><p>Agora defina apenas gatinhos como importante e deixe rosas sem alteração.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 134838,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para que serve a tag <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Isso dá ênfase ao texto</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Adiciona uma quebra de linha</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Adiciona uma quebra de linha.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você coloca <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> entre duas palavras em um parágrafo. Qual é o efeito?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A segunda palavra vai para uma nova linha</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As duas palavras ficam em itálico</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">As duas palavras se dividem em parágrafos separados</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A segunda palavra vai para uma nova linha.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 134814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual dessas tags é uma tag vazia ou auto-fechamento?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma tag vazia não tem tag de fechamento nem conteúdo. Qual destas é uma tag vazia?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 134839,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual dessas tags dá ênfase ao texto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O elemento <code>em</code> dá ênfase ao texto e o deixa em itálico.</p><p>Você envolve uma palavra de uma frase com <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>. O que muda?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Somente a palavra envolvida fica em itálico.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A frase inteira fica em itálico.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A palavra envolvida começa em uma nova linha.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Somente a palavra envolvida fica em itálico.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 134815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para que servem as tags <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eles definem o texto como importante</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Elas tornam o texto inquebrável por quebra de linha</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eles definem o texto como importante.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O elemento <code>strong</code> marca o texto como importante e o deixa em negrito.</p><p>Você escreve <code>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warning&lt;/strong&gt;: wet floor.&lt;/p&gt;</code>.</p><p>Qual texto é marcado como importante e aparece em negrito?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Warning</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Warning: wet floor.</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>: wet floor.</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Warning</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 134816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dê ênfase ao título do álbum adicionando as tags de ênfase de abertura e fechamento.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" I just listened to \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Abbey Road\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" for the first time.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use tags correspondentes para dar ênfase somente ao título do álbum e exibi-lo em itálico.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" I just listened to \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Abbey Road\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" for the first time.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 134819,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione uma quebra de linha ao endereço entre <em>Mimo</em> e <em>Vienna, Austria</em>, de modo que <em>Mimo</em> apareça em uma linha e <em>Vienna, Austria</em> apareça abaixo dela.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Mimo \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Vienna, Austria \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Coloque cada parte do endereço em sua própria linha.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Mimo \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Karlsplatz 1 \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Vienna, Austria \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;rb&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 134817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
